EVIDENCE LEVEL
This release is packaging and interfaces. It is NOT a Game-R result and carries no claim
that any representation trains better than any other. It was built independently of the
tournament so that whichever surface the integrator selects can be plugged in at
integration time (see surfaces.py). Nothing here may be labelled R*.

WHAT WAS ACTUALLY VERIFIED
Round-trip, determinism, status enforcement, canonical-adapter fidelity and the frozen
NativeVerifier's response to both compatibility profiles are covered by
tests/releases/. No model was called, no GPU was used, no network was touched, no Lean
was built, and no file listed in artifacts/manifests/SEALED_SPLITS.json was read.
